WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:02.503
Sophie, are you ready to begin?

00:00:02.586 --> 00:00:04.296
Take me back.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.757
Where were you before?

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:09.384
And before that?

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:11.053
You jumped.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.846
And before that?

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:16.266
Can you keep going?

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.272
Do you know what it feels like...

00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:25.734
to not remember anything?

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:30.072
Everyone keeps telling me
who they think I am.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.365
To fresh starts.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:35.160
But if my life was so perfect,
why did I try to end it?

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.752
Sophie, it's time to move forward.

00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:45.963
But I need to know what really happened.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.089
We do know.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:51.426
No, we think we know,
based on what we think happened.

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:55.347
What if I didn't jump?

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.353
Was there anything unusual about that day?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.648
You were saying all kinds of crazy things.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.525
A man pushed you from the boat.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:07.818
Your ID said one name,

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.570
and you kept insisting
it was something else.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.866
♪ It's the darkest hour ♪

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.369
♪ In our forest home ♪

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:20.455
People with perfect lives
don't usually jump off of ferries.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:24.168
Day of the accident,
your husband's alibi is a lie.

00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:27.337
If you're starting
to remember some things,

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.339
that must be really scary.

00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:33.677
Sometimes it's hard
not knowing your own secrets.

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:38.307
We can't just pretend we're new people,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.644
or that the past doesn't exist.

00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:47.274
You really don't remember, do you?

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:49.109
Your husband's not who you think he is.

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:50.194
Why did you lie?

00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:52.863
She's starting to
ask questions I can't answer.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.698
Maybe I was wrong about everything.

00:01:57.451 --> 00:01:58.911
Sophie, what's going on?

00:01:59.328 --> 00:02:01.914
Just... putting the pieces together.

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:05.459
♪ It's a perfect world ♪

